    "On the iPad: select your character, Cast ▸ My iPhone. Prop this phone up facing you, far enough to see your shoulders and hands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sull'iPad: seleziona il personaggio, Cast ▸ Il mio iPhone. Appoggia questo telefono rivolto verso di te, abbastanza lontano da vedere spalle e mani."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "على الآيباد: اختر شخصيتك، الشخصيات ▸ آيفوني. ثبّت هذا الهاتف مواجهًا لك وعلى مسافة تكفي لرؤية كتفيك ويديك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the selected object, else on the camera, starting at the playhead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sull'oggetto selezionato, altrimenti sulla camera, a partire dalla testina."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "على العنصر المحدد، وإلا على الكاميرا، بدءًا من رأس التشغيل."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the selection; a character's goes on its head.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sulla selezione; quello di un personaggio va sulla testa."
          }
